helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0108.xhp	0	help	par_id2783898				0	cs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable an Internet connection for %PRODUCTNAME. If you need a Proxy, check the %PRODUCTNAME Proxy settings in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet. Then choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Online Update - Check for Updates to check for the availability of a newer version of your office suite.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
