helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id7923825				0	cs	Zvolte \<emph\>Soubor - Otevřít\</emph\> pro otevření databázového souboru.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id9448530				0	cs	Zvolte \<emph\>Nástroje - SQL\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176	91			0	cs	Click the \<emph\>Create Query in SQL View\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3154071\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_dbnewquerysql.png\" width=\"0.1862in\" height=\"0.1862in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154071\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> or				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786	92			0	cs	Select an existing query from the list and click the \<emph\>Edit\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3156212\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_dbqueryedit.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156212\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3083443				0	cs	V okně \<emph\>Dotaz\</emph\> zvolte \<emph\>Zobrazit - Pohled návrhu vyp/zap\</emph\>. Upravte SQL příkaz.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3152460	96			0	cs	Click the \<emph\>Run\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3152886\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_sbaexecutesql.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152886\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>. The result of the query is displayed in the upper window.				20200411 15:09:53
