helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	optid3155421				0	cs	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/010000000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> dialog to change a variety of settings you will use in $[officename] modules. Items presented in the \<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\> menu will change depending on the module you are using.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3145071				0	cs	In \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/language_select.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - Language Settings\</emph\>\</link\>, you will find options for your default language and currency setting.				20200411 15:09:53
