helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748				0	cs	Poklepáním na graf vstoupíte do režimu úprav grafu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	cs	Click on any bar of the bar series you want to edit. All bars of this series are now selected.				20200411 15:09:53
