helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FF				0	cs	Copies the formatting that is specified in Table, Text Flow, Borders, and Background tab pages in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Table\</item\> dialog. The paragraph and character formatting are also copied.				20200411 15:09:53
