helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153088				0	cs	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_GRID\"\>Specifies whether to display grid lines between the cells.\</ahelp\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>For printing, choose \<emph\>Format - Page - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05070500.xhp\" name=\"Sheet\"\>\<emph\>Sheet\</emph\>\</link\> and mark the \<emph\>Grid\</emph\> check box.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
