helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id0125201009445727				0	cs	The "Default" entry selects the language of the user interface for the operating system. If this language is not available in the %PRODUCTNAME installation, the language of the %PRODUCTNAME installation is the default language.				20200411 15:09:53
