helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153124				0	cs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Set the typographic options for cells or paragraphs in Asian language files. To enable Asian language support, choose \<emph\>Language Settings - Languages\</emph\> in the Options dialog box, and then select the \<emph\>Enabled\</emph\> box in the \<emph\>Asian language support\</emph\> area.\</ahelp\> The Asian typography options are ignored in HTML documents.				20200411 15:09:53
