helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147317				0	cs	Defines the minimum and maximum number of times that the character in front of the opening bracket can occur. For example, "tre{1,2}" finds and selects "tre" and "tree".				20200411 15:09:53
