helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154100				0	cs	\<bookmark_value\>comments;inserting/editing/deleting/printing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting; comments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>editing; comments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>deleting;comments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Navigator;comments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>printing;comments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>records; inserting comments \</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>remarks, see also comments\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
