helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\parentheses.xhp	0	help	par_id3148489				0	cs	size *2 langle x rangle				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\parentheses.xhp	0	help	par_id3150344				0	cs	size *2 \\langle x \\rangle				20200411 15:09:53
