helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3859675				0	cs	=ISNUMBER(VLOOKUP(1;A1:C1;3)) => FALSE (C1, dříve bylo TRUE)				20200411 15:09:53
