helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148599				0	cs	A security is issued on 2001-02-28. First interest is set for 2001-08-31. The settlement date is 2001-05-01. The Rate is 0.1 or 10% and Par is 1000 currency units. Interest is paid half-yearly (frequency is 2). The basis is the US method (0). How much interest has accrued?				20200411 15:09:53
