helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154541				0	cs	A security is issued on 2001-04-01. The maturity date is set for 2001-06-15. The Rate is 0.1 or 10% and Par is 1000 currency units. The basis of the daily/annual calculation is the daily balance (3). How much interest has accrued?				20200411 15:09:53
