helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902				0	cs	A security is purchased on 2001-01-25; the maturity date is 2001-11-15. The price (purchase price) is 97, the redemption value is 100. Using daily balance calculation (basis 3) how high is the settlement (discount)?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152797	389			0	cs	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=DISC("2001-01-25";"2001-11-15";97;100;3)\</item\> returns about 0.0372 or 3.72 per cent.				20200411 15:09:53
