helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3144758	132			0	cs	            \<emph\>Values\</emph\> represents an array containing the values.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233	133			0	cs	            \<emph\>Guess\</emph\> (optional) is the estimated value. An iterative method is used to calculate the internal rate of return. If you can provide only few values, you should provide an initial guess to enable the iteration.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151258				0	cs	Příklad				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150630				0	cs	Under the assumption that cell contents are A1=\<item type=\"input\"\>-10000\</item\>, A2=\<item type=\"input\"\>3500\</item\>, A3=\<item type=\"input\"\>7600\</item\> and A4=\<item type=\"input\"\>1000\</item\>, the formula \<item type=\"input\"\>=IRR(A1:A4)\</item\> gives a result of 11,33%.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151012				0	cs	\<bookmark_value\>calculating; interests for unchanged amortization installments\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>interests for unchanged amortization installments\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>ISPMT function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
