helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155544				0	cs	\<emph\>Počet2\</emph\> počet vybraných položek ze sady..				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1997131				0	cs	COMBINA returns the number of unique ways to choose these items, where the order of choosing is irrelevant, and repetition of items is allowed. For example if there are 3 items A, B and C in a set, you can choose 2 items in 6 different ways, namely AA, AB, AC, BB, BC and CC.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id2052064				0	cs	COMBINA implementuje vzorec: (Počet1+Počet2-1)! / (Počet2!(Počet1-1)!)				20200411 15:09:53
