helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152688				0	cs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sečte první prvky mocninné řady.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152708				0	cs	SERIESSUM(x;n;m;koeficienty) = koeficient_1*x^n + koeficient_2*x^(n+m) + koeficient_3*x^(n+2m) +...+ koeficient_i*x^(n+(i-1)m)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152724				0	cs	Syntaxe				20200411 15:09:53
