helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3158196				0	cs	Returns \<emph\>Number\</emph\> rounded to \<emph\>Count\</emph\> decimal places. If Count is omitted or zero, the function rounds to the nearest integer. If Count is negative, the function rounds to the nearest 10, 100, 1000, etc.				20200411 15:09:53
