helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156104				0	cs	When a possible spelling error is encountered, the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Spellcheck\</item\> dialog opens and $[officename] offers some suggested corrections.				20200411 15:09:53
