helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	cs	Aktuální datum je možné vložit jako pole, které se aktualizuje při každém otevření dokumentu, nebo jako pole, které aktualizováno nebude.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3147679				0	cs	Zvolte \<emph\>Vložit - Pole - Jiné\</emph\> a klepněte na záložku \<emph\>Dokument\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	cs	Click “Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list and do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602				0	cs	To insert the date as a field that updates each time you open the document, click ”Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Select\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154241				0	cs	To insert the date as a field that does not update, click “Date (fixed)” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Select\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
