helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\delete_from_dict.xhp	0	help	par_id3151391				0	cs	Select the user-defined dictionary that you want to edit in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>User-defined\</item\> list, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
