helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3496200				0	cs	V seznamu \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Styl\</item\> zvolte stránkový styl. Můžete také nastavit nastavit nové číslo strany. Klepněte na \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id7599108				0	cs	The selected page style will be used from the current paragraph to the next page break with style. You may need to create the new page style first.				20200411 15:09:53
