helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145110				0	cs	Udělejte jedno z následujícího:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3156252				0	cs	To apply the custom page style to a single page, select the default page style that is used in your document in the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153376				0	cs	To apply the custom page style to more than one page, select its name in the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box. To stop using the style, insert a manual page break and assign it a different page style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154252				0	cs	Pro nastavení voleb rozvržení pro styl stránky použijte záložky a potom klepněte na tlačítko \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
