helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3155888				0	cs	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page Style\</item\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
