helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155605				0	cs	Je možné měnit hierarchii nadpisů nebo přiřadit úroveň v hierarchii vlastnímu stylu odstavce. Také je  možné ke stylu odstavce pro nadpis přidat číslování kapitol a podkapitol. Ve výchozím stavu je na nejvyšší úrovni v hierarchii stylů styl odstavce "Nadpis 1"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155626				0	cs	Přidání samočinného číslování stylu nadpisu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	cs	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155891				0	cs	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Paragraph Style\</item\> box, select the heading style that you want to add chapter numbers to.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3150513				0	cs	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbers\</item\> box, select the numbering style that you want to use, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CE				0	cs	To Remove Automatic Outline Numbering From a Heading Paragraph				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D5				0	cs	Klepněte na začátek textu v odstavci nadpisu, hned za číslo.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D9				0	cs	Pro smazání čísla stiskněte klávesu \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Backspace\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155552				0	cs	To Use a Custom Paragraph Style as a Heading				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155571				0	cs	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147758				0	cs	Vyberte vlastní styl v poli \<emph\>Styl odstavce\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147782	39			0	cs	Click the heading level that you want to assign to the custom paragraph style in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Level\</item\> list. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147808				0	cs	Klepněte na \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
